# Evaluations

This directory will contain the evaluation protocol, task manifests, aggregate results, and redacted execution traces for Cognitive Sharding.

Each published evaluation should record:

- task and environment;
- workflow and action counts;
- model versions and runtime settings;
- retry and re-planning policy;
- human interventions;
- completion grader;
- latency and peak memory; and
- terminal failure category.

No evaluation result is published here yet.
